<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>阴阳平衡 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E9%98%B4%E9%98%B3%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 14:56:11 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E9%98%B4%E9%98%B3%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>跟倪师学黄帝内经笔记之三：养生之法</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen-yangshengzhifa/</link><pubDate>Sat, 03 May 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen-yangshengzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/">素问笔记</category><description>系统阐述了中医&amp;quot;天人合一&amp;quot;的养生智慧，其核心在于顺应自然规律以调和生命节律。该体系以四时阴阳为总纲，提出&amp;quot;春生夏长秋收冬藏&amp;quot;的起居原则（如春日缓行、冬宜早卧），强调饮食需守&amp;quot;五味调和、饥饱有度&amp;quot;（甘养肝、辛养肾，晚餐不过饱），锻炼讲究&amp;quot;因时制宜、动静相济&amp;quot;（昼练易筋经、夜避风寒，五脏排毒功法）。更注重精神调摄，主张&amp;quot;清心寡欲、神气内守&amp;quot;（减少思虑、专注内在），并配套特殊气候防护（节气转换避风邪）、脏腑观想护气法等独特技法，形成了一套贯穿&amp;quot;食饮有节、起居有常、不妄作劳、形神共养&amp;quot;的完整养生实践体系，最终实现&amp;quot;阴平阳秘、病安从来&amp;quot;的健康境界。</description></item><item><title>调经论篇第六十二</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-62/</link><pubDate>Wed, 02 Apr 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-62/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>本文系统阐述了中医虚实补泻的理论基础，详细分析了神、气、血、形、志五类有余不足的临床表现及相应的针刺补泻方法，并深入探讨了阴阳气血失调的病理机制及治疗原则。</description></item></channel></rss>